{"file": "tori.trades_110_335214v_DMqS0hJPNKM.mp4", "language": "en", "segments": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 2.26, "text": "On another day in the life of Tory Trades,", "words": [{"w": "On", "start": 0.0, "end": 0.14}, {"w": "another", "start": 0.14, "end": 0.42}, {"w": "day", "start": 0.42, "end": 0.76}, {"w": "in", "start": 0.76, "end": 0.86}, {"w": "the", "start": 0.86, "end": 1.04}, {"w": "life", "start": 1.04, "end": 1.24}, {"w": "of", "start": 1.24, "end": 1.52}, {"w": "Tory", "start": 1.52, "end": 1.7}, {"w": "Trades,", "start": 1.7, "end": 2.26}]}, {"start": 2.76, "end": 4.72, "text": "doesn't seem that exciting.", "words": [{"w": "doesn't", "start": 2.76, "end": 3.14}, {"w": "seem", "start": 3.14, "end": 3.38}, {"w": "that", "start": 3.38, "end": 3.72}, {"w": "exciting.", "start": 3.72, "end": 4.72}]}, {"start": 5.2, "end": 7.24, "text": "Today, I think I only saw one other human.", "words": [{"w": "Today,", "start": 5.2, "end": 5.36}, {"w": "I", "start": 5.72, "end": 5.8}, {"w": "think", "start": 5.8, "end": 5.96}, {"w": "I", "start": 5.96, "end": 6.12}, {"w": "only", "start": 6.12, "end": 6.3}, {"w": "saw", "start": 6.3, "end": 6.5}, {"w": "one", "start": 6.5, "end": 6.76}, {"w": "other", "start": 6.76, "end": 6.96}, {"w": "human.", "start": 6.96, "end": 7.24}]}, {"start": 7.78, "end": 8.78, "text": "Oh no, I saw two humans.", "words": [{"w": "Oh", "start": 7.78, "end": 7.92}, {"w": "no,", "start": 7.92, "end": 8.0}, {"w": "I", "start": 8.16, "end": 8.22}, {"w": "saw", "start": 8.22, "end": 8.3}, {"w": "two", "start": 8.3, "end": 8.48}, {"w": "humans.", "start": 8.48, "end": 8.78}]}, {"start": 9.32, "end": 10.96, "text": "One was the owner of the studio", "words": [{"w": "One", "start": 9.32, "end": 9.64}, {"w": "was", "start": 9.64, "end": 9.94}, {"w": "the", "start": 9.94, "end": 10.12}, {"w": "owner", "start": 10.12, "end": 10.4}, {"w": "of", "start": 10.4, "end": 10.58}, {"w": "the", "start": 10.58, "end": 10.66}, {"w": "studio", "start": 10.66, "end": 10.96}]}, {"start": 10.96, "end": 12.6, "text": "and the other one was my mother.", "words": [{"w": "and", "start": 10.96, "end": 11.56}, {"w": "the", "start": 11.56, "end": 11.68}, {"w": "other", "start": 11.68, "end": 11.78}, {"w": "one", "start": 11.78, "end": 11.92}, {"w": "was", "start": 11.92, "end": 12.1}, {"w": "my", "start": 12.1, "end": 12.3}, {"w": "mother.", "start": 12.3, "end": 12.6}]}, {"start": 13.28, "end": 15.16, "text": "But we talked about trading all day.", "words": [{"w": "But", "start": 13.28, "end": 13.56}, {"w": "we", "start": 13.56, "end": 13.64}, {"w": "talked", "start": 13.64, "end": 13.78}, {"w": "about", "start": 13.78, "end": 13.94}, {"w": "trading", "start": 13.94, "end": 14.22}, {"w": "all", "start": 14.22, "end": 14.82}, {"w": "day.", "start": 14.82, "end": 15.16}]}, {"start": 15.54, "end": 17.46, "text": "It's going through my brain all day.", "words": [{"w": "It's", "start": 15.54, "end": 15.58}, {"w": "going", "start": 15.58, "end": 15.76}, {"w": "through", "start": 15.76, "end": 15.98}, {"w": "my", "start": 15.98, "end": 16.12}, {"w": "brain", "start": 16.12, "end": 16.48}, {"w": "all", "start": 16.48, "end": 17.08}, {"w": "day.", "start": 17.08, "end": 17.46}]}, {"start": 17.94, "end": 20.78, "text": "Trading is just, it's everything.", "words": [{"w": "Trading", "start": 17.94, "end": 18.18}, {"w": "is", "start": 18.18, "end": 19.18}, {"w": "just,", "start": 19.18, "end": 19.7}, {"w": "it's", "start": 20.14, "end": 20.4}, {"w": "everything.", "start": 20.4, "end": 20.78}]}, {"start": 21.16, "end": 22.02, "text": "It is everywhere.", "words": [{"w": "It", "start": 21.16, "end": 21.3}, {"w": "is", "start": 21.3, "end": 21.44}, {"w": "everywhere.", "start": 21.44, "end": 22.02}]}, {"start": 22.5, "end": 23.44, "text": "It's every conversation.", "words": [{"w": "It's", "start": 22.5, "end": 22.7}, {"w": "every", "start": 22.7, "end": 22.88}, {"w": "conversation.", "start": 22.88, "end": 23.44}]}, {"start": 24.12, "end": 24.58, "text": "It's everywhere.", "words": [{"w": "It's", "start": 24.12, "end": 24.38}, {"w": "everywhere.", "start": 24.38, "end": 24.58}]}, {"start": 24.96, "end": 26.16, "text": "I don't hate that, love that.", "words": [{"w": "I", "start": 24.96, "end": 25.08}, {"w": "don't", "start": 25.08, "end": 25.16}, {"w": "hate", "start": 25.16, "end": 25.36}, {"w": "that,", "start": 25.36, "end": 25.56}, {"w": "love", "start": 25.72, "end": 25.96}, {"w": "that.", "start": 25.96, "end": 26.16}]}, {"start": 26.4, "end": 29.0, "text": "I mean, I'm so passionate about trading.", "words": [{"w": "I", "start": 26.4, "end": 26.52}, {"w": "mean,", "start": 26.52, "end": 26.68}, {"w": "I'm", "start": 26.94, "end": 27.26}, {"w": "so", "start": 27.26, "end": 28.1}, {"w": "passionate", "start": 28.1, "end": 28.48}, {"w": "about", "start": 28.48, "end": 28.76}, {"w": "trading.", "start": 28.76, "end": 29.0}]}, {"start": 29.0, "end": 31.68, "text": "I couldn't have picked any better industry to spend 10 years on.", "words": [{"w": "I", "start": 29.0, "end": 29.46}, {"w": "couldn't", "start": 29.46, "end": 29.7}, {"w": "have", "start": 29.7, "end": 29.74}, {"w": "picked", "start": 29.74, "end": 29.86}, {"w": "any", "start": 29.86, "end": 30.08}, {"w": "better", "start": 30.08, "end": 30.28}, {"w": "industry", "start": 30.28, "end": 30.64}, {"w": "to", "start": 30.64, "end": 30.82}, {"w": "spend", "start": 30.82, "end": 30.98}, {"w": "10", "start": 30.98, "end": 31.26}, {"w": "years", "start": 31.26, "end": 31.46}, {"w": "on.", "start": 31.46, "end": 31.68}]}]}